Routing databases
Source: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat
Revision: 766969db0401dc72fe698a0a03080e538e1be0cb
Files: geoip.metadb (packaged as GEOIP.metadb), geosite.dat (as GEOSITE.dat)
Project license: GNU GPL v3 (see licenses/meta-rules-dat-LICENSE)
The upstream project documents the datasets and rule lists used to generate
these files. Download revisions and SHA-256 hashes are in scripts/core.env.

Country flags
Source: https://flagcdn.com / https://flagpedia.net/download/icons
The provider distributes these images as public domain, based on Wikimedia
Commons flag artwork. Packaged in shared/src/commonMain/composeResources/files/flags/.

